          <title>Parasitic Pollen Eaters</title>
          <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
          <author>Unknown</author>
          <link>https://kyleparkercunningham.com/oeuvre/painting/2013/parasitic-pollen-eaters/</link>
